<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink163-kilavi">
        ituvumatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
        This one is also that [= the previous one].</p>
  </div>  
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink163">
<l>peruṅkaṭaṟ karaiyatu ciṟuveṇ kākkai</l>
<l>yiruṅkaḻit tuvalai yoliyiṟ ṟuñcun</l>
<l>tuṟaivaṉ ṟuṟanteṉat tuṟante</l>
<l>ṉiṟaiyēr muṉkai nīṅkiya vaḷaiyē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Because the man from the shore - in which the small, white crow</l>
        <l>Of the vast seashore sleeps among the sound of sprays</l>
        <l> from the dark backwaters - abandoned [me]</l>
        <l>I abandoned my bangles which slipped to my  forearms, rising to [my] joint.</l>
        
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
